===========================================================================
We include unit tests in the build. I'm pretty sure we want this, it keeps
us from making a bum package with something that testing could find.

One consequence of this is that we need the merra and absco data used
by the unit tests. Rather than using some complicated way of passing this
in, we just do a symbolic link to this directory for absco and merra.
For example:

ln -s /Users/smyth/absco .
ln -s /Users/smyth/merra .

Without this data, the unit tests and therefore the build will fail.
===========================================================================
